"""WellNest Teas: Three Projects refresh (R107, Max via WellNest, Oct 17 2026 20:04 ICT; Max 20:09: build directly on the mockups).
Source: /workspace/wellnest/teas/ (lookbook 'WellNest Teas - Three Projects', Roselle Refresh Project Brief, mockup-*.jpg, pouch-*.jpg).
One deck per tea, exactly 10 picks. Every pick = confirm the draft 'Our Pick, Swipe To Confirm' item (option A, the mockup as drafted)
or swap to one sensible alternative (option B, the same mockup edited). 'From Your Swipes' items are settled and never re-asked.
Alternatives come from the source and the earlier WellNest tea decks (tools/wn_tea_content.py, tools/wn_roselle_content.py); ratios are rough
starting points, as the lookbook says. Flags (not confirmed): Energy and Beauty names need a Thai FDA label check; the Thai name กระเจี๊ยบ
and the 'caffeine free' line stay off the Roselle pouch until confirmed. No cannabis or hemp anywhere; no partner logos (name only).
Option = dict(label, desc, img=spec, flag=optional). Image specs are rendered by tools/wn_teas_img.py."""
FDA = "Name needs a Thai FDA label check before printing."
THAI = "Thai name กระเจี๊ยบ and 'caffeine free' stay off until confirmed."
def O(label, desc, img, flag=""): return dict(label=label, desc=desc, img=img, flag=flag)
def ING(tea, rows, hi=None, photo=None, head="Ingredients"):  # mockup + side tag listing the blend
    return dict(base="mock", tea=tea, tag=dict(head=head, rows=rows, hi=hi, photo=photo))
def TAG(tea, head, lines, photo=None): return dict(base="mock", tea=tea, tag=dict(head=head, lines=lines, photo=photo))
def P(tea, ops=(), crop="full"): return dict(base="pouch", tea=tea, ops=list(ops), crop=crop)
TEAS = []
def tea(key, project, loc, name, about, picks):
    assert len(picks) == 10, (key, len(picks)); TEAS.append(dict(key=key, project=project, loc=loc, name=name, about=about, picks=picks))
